# Notion Thief: "If an opponent would draw a card except the first one they draw in each of their draw steps, instead that
# player skips that draw and you draw a card" (CR 614.1a-b, 121.6). Bot1 flashes it in on turn 1. Bot2's draw for its turn 2
# is the first card it draws in its draw step and is drawn as usual (the check before its main phase). Its Ancestral Recall
# is three draws, each replaced on its own (CR 121.2): Bot2 draws none of them and Bot1 draws three. Bot1's own draws are no
# opponent's and are left alone.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Notion Thief
Swamp x4
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Ancestral Recall
Swamp x5
Swamp x20

[Actions]
